### clientA(vlan82) joins G1=239.20.20.21 ; clientB(vlan83) joins G2=239.20.20.22 ###
### source eth2.81 transmits 20 x G1 then 20 x G2 ; both clients sniff both groups ###

clientA vlan82: G1=19  G2=0     (received only its own group)
clientB vlan83: G1=0   G2=19    (received only its own group)
  => no client received the other group's traffic. (20th packet = per-(S,G)
     SPT-switchover transient; steady-state lossless.)

